ery fourth egg contains a stationary 50-HP Drone: attacks for 5, 10, 15 damage and so on. Burrowers move west; Skitters choose west, northwest or southwest. Both then attack for 1 damage of their element, even if blocked from moving; at the left edge they instead attack for 12 or 9 respectively and disappear. All moving insects swap through player cards, moving leftmost first. Newborns first act on the following turn; all vanish when the Hive dies. At the end of each full move cycle, if afflicted by Burn, Poison or Corrode, spends its next move on Purify to clear all three, then resumes its cycle.","counter":"Cover eggs with expendable cards to recycle them, or remove eggs with Machine Elves. Prepare for mixed elements. Storm Canopy does not hit Ideons; use targeted attacks, Lucid Guide or Scouring Gale.","nemesis":"Slow decks","grouped":false,"stratum":3,"hive":true,"bossMode":"stalker","statusImmunities":["burn","poison","corrode"],"entityUid":324,"maxHp":15,"cycle":15,"buff":0,"guard":0,"status":{"burn":0,"poison":0,"corrode":0},"purifyPending":false,"broodOrder":["Chaos","Light","Earth","Fire","Arcane","Water","Wind"],"eggsLaid":44}],"order":56,"firstAttackTurn":15,"permanent":{"focus":2},"next":{"focus":0,"insight":0},"shields":[{"uid":400,"slot":30,"owner":6,"block":0,"element":"Arcane"},{"uid":401,"slot":31,"owner":5,"block":0,"element":"Arcane"},{"uid":402,"slot":29,"owner":7,"block":0,"element":"Arcane"}],"bracelets":[{"uid":177,"block":0,"element":"Arcane","name":"Gold Bracelet"},{"uid":294,"block":4,"element":"Arcane","name":"Silver Bracelet"}],"armorBlock":0,"jobs":[{"kind":"corruptionRound"},{"kind":"nextTurn"}],"reaction":null,"relief":0,"mirror":false,"healUses":{"89":2},"huskConverted":false,"focus":6,"channel":3,"insight":5,"revealInsight":5,"milky":false,"hiveLarvaOpening":true},"reward":{"cards":null,"boss":true,"gem":false,"setting":false},"revealedArchon":"mindHive","nextTavernHealer":true,"nextHealerHint":true,"outcome":"win","cause":""}